## Install @PRODUCT_NAME@ @VERSION@

These builds are not notarized by Apple and not signed with a Windows
certificate, so the first start needs the steps below (details in
[docs/release.md](https://github.com/@REPOSITORY@/blob/@TAG@/docs/release.md)).

**macOS and Linux, one command** (checks the SHA-256 of the download, installs
into your home folder, no administrator rights):

```sh
curl -fsSL https://github.com/@REPOSITORY@/releases/download/@TAG@/install.sh | sh
```

**macOS with Homebrew**:

```sh
brew install @REPOSITORY_OWNER@/tap/@SLUG@
```

**Windows**: download `@SLUG@-@VERSION@-windows-x86_64.zip`, unpack it anywhere
and run `@IDE@.exe`. Windows SmartScreen may say "Windows protected your PC":
choose "More info", then "Run anyway". On a managed machine the policy may
block programs in user folders.

**By hand**: download the archive of your system and `SHA256SUMS`, check it
(`shasum -a 256 -c --ignore-missing SHA256SUMS`), unpack it.

Archives: `@SLUG@-@VERSION@-{macos,linux}-{aarch64,x86_64}.tar.gz`,
`@SLUG@-@VERSION@-windows-x86_64.zip`. `@SLUG@.rb` is the Homebrew formula for
this release.

